From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:31:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 27/35] Sync the liveness engine: five-model bundle
 pad-2026.10.4 (F1, F6, F7)

Engine jars and models from Mosip26 74317e6 (fix round 1):
- F1: SFace face matcher (FaceMatcher, created from
  OnnxFaceAnalyzerFactory.createMatcher; not wired into the flows yet,
  that is fix round 2). The bundle has a fifth role, MATCHER:
  face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx, 38,696,353 bytes, sha256
  0ba9fbfa..., signed with the dev key as pad-2026.10.4.
- F6: relative motion-blur check (rolling median of lap_var per session).
- F7: landmark-tracking ROI for large head turns.
- The factory now verifies an installed bundle only when it is newer
  than the bundled one. This phone's store still held the four-model
  pad-2026.10.1 from the P5-5 install test; before the fix it failed
  verification and every real gate ended in MODEL_INTEGRITY_FAILED.
- ONNX Runtime session logging is set to errors only (SFace printed 174
  initializer warnings per load).

The four jars are rebuilt (analyzer 42,369,231 bytes with the bundle);
CameraXFrameSource is unchanged. Debug APK 488,250,639 bytes (was about
452 MB).

Module tests 73/73. On the phone (debug build): preload "bundle
pad-2026.10.4 verified and loaded in 504 ms (CPU)"; fake Resident face
gate PASSED.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
